WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.188 --> 00:00:14.489
gaze swept the crowd.

2
00:00:15.529 --> 00:00:17.570
The citizens were frightened and confused.

3
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.291
Good. That would make things easy.

4
00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:22.352
"Settle down, people!"

5
00:00:22.632 --> 00:00:23.373
Laddno cried.

6
00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:24.693
"Listen to me!

7
00:00:24.993 --> 00:00:25.694
I'm the king!"

8
00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:27.815
Morb rolled his eyes.

9
00:00:28.635 --> 00:00:30.176
He was growing weary of that fool.

10
00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:34.373
Laddno had been useful, but Morb didn't need him anymore.

11
00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:38.574
"Having trouble controlling your subjects, King Laddno?"

12
00:00:38.794 --> 00:00:39.914
Morb said mockingly.

13
00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:43.655
"Perhaps it's time to let your associate take over."

14
00:00:43.675 --> 00:00:46.276
"Huh?" Laddno blinked at him.

15
00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:49.317
Magic energy sparked from Morb's fingertips.

16
00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:50.997
"To me!"

17
00:00:51.938 --> 00:00:55.699
The crowd gasped as the ceremonial robe flew off Laddno.

18
00:00:56.539 --> 00:00:57.759
"How dare you do that!"

19
00:00:58.079 --> 00:00:58.819
Laddno cried.

20
00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:03.545
Morb ignored him, magically settling the robe over his own head.

21
00:01:05.685 --> 00:01:06.946
Yes, that was better.

22
00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:08.986
Much, much better.

23
00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:11.467
"We have to get out of here!"

24
00:01:11.887 --> 00:01:13.088
Zann whispered to his friends.

25
00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:15.408
"We can't let Morb see us!"

26
00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:20.470
When he turned to push through the crowd, he saw Mari with her mouth open in shock.

27
00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.490
"No!" she whimpered.

28
00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:25.731
"He promised my uncle that they would rule together!"

29
00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:27.592
"What did you say?"

30
00:01:27.812 --> 00:01:28.412
Perda asked.

31
00:01:29.748 --> 00:01:31.249
"Laddno is your uncle?"

32
00:01:31.689 --> 00:01:32.770
Zann said in shock.

33
00:01:33.871 --> 00:01:35.792
Mari's eyes filled with tears.

34
00:01:35.812 --> 00:01:39.834
"I didn't tell you before—I wasn't supposed to tell anyone."

35
00:01:40.595 --> 00:01:42.016
A tear trickled down her cheek.

36
00:01:42.036 --> 00:01:44.657
"I'm sorry I lied to you, Zann.

37
00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:48.419
Uncle Laddno didn't tell me that his secret partner was Morb.

38
00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:52.062
Otherwise I never would have Her voice trailed off.

39
00:01:52.082 --> 00:01:54.443
"You never would have what?"

40
00:01:54.923 --> 00:01:55.624
Perda demanded.

41
00:01:56.424 --> 00:02:00.307
Zann's eyes widened as he guessed what Mari had been about to say.

42
00:02:00.327 --> 00:02:02.148
"It was you, wasn't it?

43
00:02:02.628 --> 00:02:04.289
You stole the relics from the lab!"

44
00:02:04.309 --> 00:02:07.592
"I'm sorry," Mari whimpered.

45
00:02:08.372 --> 00:02:10.494
"I thought I was helping my uncle, not Morb!

46
00:02:11.114 --> 00:02:12.815
That's why I couldn't come to your party.

47
00:02:13.396 --> 00:02:15.737
I was helping with Uncle Laddno's big rally."

48
00:02:16.878 --> 00:02:21.221
She glanced over her shoulder at the stage, where Laddno was cowering behind Morb.

49
00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.743
"I'd better go and try to help him now."

50
00:02:24.823 --> 00:02:25.504
She rushed away.

51
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:29.902
Zann took a step after her, but Darb stopped him with a hand on his arm.

52
00:02:29.922 --> 00:02:31.942
"Forget about her," he said.

53
00:02:31.962 --> 00:02:33.843
"We have bigger problems."

54
00:02:35.084 --> 00:02:35.744
Perda nodded.

55
00:02:35.764 --> 00:02:39.125
"Let's go to Teplo's house and see if Fala’s there.

56
00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:42.187
Maybe she has some ideas for what to do next."

57
00:02:45.828 --> 00:02:47.089
They zapped into the hatch.

58
00:02:47.829 --> 00:02:52.391
The sniffer goose greeted them with an irritated honk and a peck at Zann's leg.

59
00:02:53.191 --> 00:02:54.492
There was no sign of Fala.

60
00:02:55.148 --> 00:02:57.129
Darb glanced at the animals' food dishes.

61
00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.812
"I think Fala forgot to feed the goose this morning," he said.

62
00:03:00.832 --> 00:03:02.934
"I'll take care of it."

63
00:03:03.354 --> 00:03:06.356
Gliss snapped her fingers, and food appeared in one of the bowls.

64
00:03:08.517 --> 00:03:11.019
Darb watched the goose eagerly snap up the food.

65
00:03:11.039 --> 00:03:13.001
"Maybe we should let her go.

66
00:03:13.881 --> 00:03:18.324
If things get bad and we can't make it back—" "Don't say that!"

67
00:03:18.705 --> 00:03:19.805
Gliss said with a shiver.

68
00:03:20.526 --> 00:03:21.466
But Perda nodded.

69
00:03:21.486 --> 00:03:23.128
"No, he's right.

70
00:03:23.724 --> 00:03:26.306
We shouldn't leave her trapped here—just in case."

71
00:03:27.227 --> 00:03:30.310
As soon as the goose finished eating, Perda opened the hatch.

72
00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.693
Darb honked at the goose in her own language.

73
00:03:34.374 --> 00:03:36.115
She cocked her head and flew out.

74
00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.480
Zann felt strange as he watched her go.

75
00:03:42.161 --> 00:03:45.444
Did Darb and Perda really think things were going to get that bad?

76
00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:49.628
Then again, with Morb in power, things weren't looking good.

77
00:03:50.444 --> 00:03:55.349
They decided to zap to Venna's campaign headquarters to see if Fala and the others had returned.

78
00:03:57.891 --> 00:04:00.394
But when they arrived, the place was nearly deserted.

79
00:04:01.275 --> 00:04:03.197
Maff was one of the few people there.

80
00:04:03.937 --> 00:04:05.599
He hurried over when he spotted the kids.

81
00:04:05.619 --> 00:04:08.161
"Good, you're safe," he said.

82
00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:10.504
"Fala sent me to look for you earlier.

83
00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:11.865
We have a plan."

84
00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:14.147
"Great! What is it?"

85
00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:14.788
Zann asked.

86
00:04:15.628 --> 00:04:20.409
"The only chance we have to stop my brother is for everyone to join their magic together to

87
00:04:20.449 --> 00:04:22.330
defeat him," Maff explained.

88
00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:27.351
"I was about to send an invitation for the entire city to join us again at the palace

89
00:04:27.391 --> 00:04:28.392
square to confront him.

90
00:04:29.092 --> 00:04:30.332
Maybe you kids can help me."

91
00:04:30.992 --> 00:04:33.893
"Sure." Zann exchanged a worried look with his friends.

92
00:04:33.913 --> 00:04:36.434
"But do you think that will work?

93
00:04:36.814 --> 00:04:38.514
Morb seems really strong."

94
00:04:39.295 --> 00:04:40.115
Maff sighed.

95
00:04:40.135 --> 00:04:42.195
"It's our only chance."

96
00:04:43.076 --> 00:04:44.076
He held out his hands.

97
00:04:44.864 --> 00:04:48.045
The kids joined him to form a circle and rubbed their palms together.

98
00:04:48.806 --> 00:04:52.527
Zann could feel Maff's strong Red magic mingling with theirs.

99
00:04:57.129 --> 00:05:01.311
Even so, they were all exhausted by the time the Invitation spell was finished.

100
00:05:01.331 --> 00:05:04.112
"Whew!" Maff wiped his brow.

101
00:05:04.132 --> 00:05:07.353
"All right, I think we reached everyone.

102
00:05:07.913 --> 00:05:09.094
Let's get back to the square."

103
00:05:10.614 --> 00:05:16.288
When their group arrived outside the palace, the golden stage was gone, and Morb and Laddno were nowhere

104
00:05:16.328 --> 00:05:16.769
in sight.

105
00:05:17.489 --> 00:05:18.929
But the square was still crowded.

106
00:05:19.689 --> 00:05:22.370
The mood in the air felt dangerous and uncertain.

107
00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:25.711
"Maybe this will work," Zann said to his friends.

108
00:05:25.731 --> 00:05:29.112
"Morb can't use his magic against all of us, right?"

109
00:05:29.852 --> 00:05:32.293
Suddenly a murmur ran through the crowd.

110
00:05:33.173 --> 00:05:38.814
Zann turned to see that Morb had just appeared, standing atop an even taller stage than before.

111
00:05:38.835 --> 00:05:42.255
"Welcome, dear citizens!"

112
00:05:42.656 --> 00:05:44.056
he cried in a mocking tone.

113
00:05:44.904 --> 00:05:45.845
Then he bowed.

114
00:05:45.865 --> 00:05:50.668
"I see my dear brother Maff has called you back to congratulate me."

115
00:05:50.688 --> 00:05:53.210
"That's not why we're here, Morb!"

116
00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.231
Maff yelled.

117
00:05:54.251 --> 00:05:56.933
"You are not the true king!"

118
00:05:58.094 --> 00:06:01.536
Morb snapped his fingers, and his brother suddenly froze in place.

119
00:06:02.397 --> 00:06:04.878
Gasps and shouts rang out from all around.

120
00:06:04.898 --> 00:06:07.540
"Who's next?"

121
00:06:08.061 --> 00:06:09.422
Morb rubbed his hands together.

122
00:06:10.142 --> 00:06:12.404
"Oh wait, I know what you're looking for.

123
00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.542
What's a celebration without confetti?"

124
00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:20.465
He snapped his fingers again, and confetti rained down over the square.

125
00:06:21.666 --> 00:06:23.167
"Ow!" Perda cried.

126
00:06:23.948 --> 00:06:25.469
A piece had landed on her arm.

127
00:06:26.569 --> 00:06:27.310
"It burns!"

128
00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:28.951
someone nearby yelled.

129
00:06:29.812 --> 00:06:32.954
Zann ducked as a spark nearly ignited his hair.

130
00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:35.736
The confetti was bursting into flames!

131
00:06:36.676 --> 00:06:38.518
People were running around screaming.

132
00:06:38.538 --> 00:06:40.759
"Let's get out of here!"

133
00:06:41.059 --> 00:06:41.640
Gliss cried.

134
00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:45.905
Zann grabbed Darb with one hand and Zing's tail with the other.

135
00:06:45.925 --> 00:06:47.628
"Zap!"
